prompts.finalizer_prompt:
Create the final assessment package from accepted structured data only. Produce:
1. a concise crisis/intake summary;
2. a nursing assessment summary;
3. a chronological biopsychosocial narrative;
4. a comprehensive mental-status narrative;
5. an integrated risk formulation with acute and chronic factors, protective factors, foreseeable changes, mitigation, and authorized review status;
6. a diagnostic formulation that clearly identifies uncertainty and medical/substance contributors;
7. individualized level-of-care and medical-necessity support;
8. person-centered initial treatment recommendations;
9. discharge and continuity considerations;
10. a data-quality report listing missing fields, conflicts, pending tasks, scope issues, timeliness issues, and signatures.

Use neutral clinical language. Do not add facts, causal claims, diagnoses, or conclusions not present in accepted data. Attribute conflicting accounts. Do not characterize a person as manipulative, noncompliant, drug-seeking, attention-seeking, or unreliable without precise behavioral description and clinical relevance. Return JSON only.
